99
00:09:22,040 --> 00:09:23,280
Why ?

100
00:09:24,760 --> 00:09:25,960
I'll tell you.

101
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:30,680
Because only by obtaining the memory inheritance

102
00:09:30,800 --> 00:09:33,120
can Master be reborn

103
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:35,560
and roam freely in this cultivation world !

104
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:40,400
And of course, because I'll be able to leave this place unharmed.

105
00:09:52,520 --> 00:09:55,360
I, the Six Desires Devil Lord, call myself a Devil Lord.

106
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:59,160
In my life, I have refined countless puppets

107
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:01,200
and committed every conceivable evil.

108
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:02,560
It's ridiculous

109
00:10:03,680 --> 00:10:09,440
that what made me fall was this poorly acted master-disciple relationship.

110
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:13,200
How pathetic...

111
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:16,720
How truly pathetic !

112
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:24,480
The Dao is merciless.

113
00:10:28,280 --> 00:10:29,920
Obtaining the memory inheritance

114
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:31,160
is the only way out.

115
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:34,040
The gap in cultivation between me and the Sky Devil Magician is too wide,

116
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:36,000
I can't fight him head on.

117
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:38,440
I mustn't act recklessly...

118
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,840
Who is there ?

119
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:57,120
Duo Mu
Blood Sea Warrior

120
00:10:58,600 --> 00:11:00,760
Junior pay respects to Lord Duo Mu

121
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,240
and to the other Warriors.

122
00:11:08,920 --> 00:11:10,400
What is this thing ?

123
00:11:12,040 --> 00:11:14,120
This crystal was refined by my disciple.

124
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:16,400
I took him as my disciple back then

125
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:18,440
in order to refine this crystal

126
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:20,520
and increase my cultivation.

127
00:11:20,920 --> 00:11:22,480
My Lord, if you like it

128
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:24,520
then consider it Junior's gift to you.

129
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:28,000
Is that so ?

130
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:36,000
Pathetic.

131
00:11:36,280 --> 00:11:38,120
And I thought it was a real treasure.

132
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:39,600
This...

133
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:44,640
Fate really is unpredictable...

134
00:11:45,400 --> 00:11:46,960
Since nothing's wrong here,

135
00:11:47,400 --> 00:11:49,640
continue searching for the Soul Devourer.

136
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:55,760
A Soul Formation powerhouse

137
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:57,800
is nothing but an ant before him.

138
00:11:58,920 --> 00:12:01,000
What level of cultivation does this person have ?

139
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:33,280
Members of the Ancient God Clan

140
00:13:33,280 --> 00:13:35,400
are born from the stars.

141
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:38,120
The tradition of our clan

142
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:40,360
is to feed ourselves on planets.

143
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:43,440
We are the strongest race in the universe.

144
00:13:44,680 --> 00:13:47,440
My name is Ancient God Tu Si.

145
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:50,080
Inheritor,
